# Google Cloud API Keys / Credentials
*-credentials.json
client_secret_*.json

# ==========================================
# EAS CLOUD BYPASS LOGIC
# ==========================================
# Everything listed above will be ignored by EAS build servers.
# Because google-services.json is deliberately REMOVED from this list compared to your .gitignore,
# EAS will now successfully upload it to the cloud to compile the Android app!
